<title>UK: Telkom at $33.75 in London at 0925 GMT.</title>
<headline>Telkom at $33.75 in London at 0925 GMT.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>PT Telkom traded at $33.75 and London at 0925 GMT on Thursday. It recorded the day's low of $33.75 and the day's high of $33.75.</p>
<p>Its previous close on Wednesday $32.600. One ADS represents 20 ordinary shares -- Jakarta newsroom (Tel: 6221-3846364).</p>
</text>
